[size=4][b][color=#55DD55]✦ Compatibility: Persistent Jobs is DEFINITELY Supported![/color][/b][/size]
[quote]
[b]Persistent Jobs is now 100% officially supported and fully integrated into AI Traffic as of v0.2.8.[/b]
Even though the [i]Persistent Jobs[/i] mod page may currently claim that AI Traffic is unsupported or incompatible, [b]this is outdated[/b]. AI Traffic v0.2.8 includes dedicated integration patches that reflect lightweight suspended cars ([i]FarCarOpt[/i]) in pathfinding, protect yard tracks, and segregate debt ledgers so both mods run together seamlessly!
[/quote]

[size=4][b][color=#FFB833]✦ What's New in Version 0.2.8[/color][/b][/size]

[list]
[*][b]30-Minute Job Desync CTD Fix:[/b] Replaced station-wide destruction locks with track-specific protection ([i]Yard.IsTrackOccupied[/i]). Vanilla DV safely cleans expired jobs every 30 mins without PhysX explosions, NaN coordinates, or crashes.
[*][b]Crash & Patch Optimizations:[/b] Eliminated recursive stack overflow crashes in station wakeup patches and debounced signal wakeup calls (0.5s cooldown) to eliminate DVSignals traversal storms.
[*][b]Wet-Weather Physics & 5-Stage Hill-Starts:[/b] 6-second cumulative ground progress tracking ends the DE2 slip-grip oscillation trap. Includes immediate rain sanding and automated controlled rollback descents.
[*][b]Active Wheel Slide Protection (WSP):[/b] Consist-wide brake slide detection scales wet service deceleration, cuts dynamic braking on drive wheel slides, and auto-sands to maintain adhesion.
[*][b]Multiple Unit (MU) Helper Automation:[/b] Trailing helper locomotives automatically spawn with double-heading cocks cut out ([i]BrakeCutout = 0.0[/i]), independent brakes released, and MU lines connected.
[*][b]Single-Track Corridor Tokens & Reverse Maneuver:[/b] Atomic tokens prevent opposing entries. In standoffs, AI sounds 3 horn bursts, turns on red marker lights, and backs into the nearest siding.
[*][b]Turnout Lock Interlocking & AI Preemption ([JNC-09]):[/b] Protects crossover switches in reserved signal blocks, enforces alignment cooldowns, and resolves AI-vs-AI turnout conflicts by signal reservation and train priority.
[*][b]Siding Shunting Handover Fix:[/b] 4-layer mast crossing check ensures trains leaving yards transition smoothly back to line speed instead of crawling at 15 km/h across the mainline.
[*][b]Yard Through-Transit Avoidance:[/b] +500,000m routing penalty keeps through trains out of yard sidings while protecting central running lines ([i][--][/i]) at full line speed.
[*][b]Military Base Career License Gating:[/b] Completely excludes AI trains from Military Base (MB), Harbor military spur, and Machine Factory military yard unless the [i]Military 1[/i] license is owned.
[*][b]Advanced INI Configuration ([i]settings.ini[/i]):[/b] Real-time tunable physics PID gains, dispatching buffers, and lighting modes, with an in-game UMM [i]Apply & Reload INI[/i] button.
[*][b]AI Lighting & EOT Markers:[/b] 4-mode locomotive headlight selector and diegetic rear End-of-Train (EOT) lanterns on freight consists and cabooses.
[/list]

[size=4][b][color=#FFB833]✦ Core Features Overview[/color][/b][/size]

[b][color=#55DD55]1. Player-Employed AI Workers (Phase 2)[/color][/b]
[list]
[*][b]Point-to-Point Delivery:[/b] Hire AI engineers via the Comms Radio ([b]AI Worker[/b] mode) to haul assembled consists from Station A to Station B.
[*][b]Dynamic Clear Siding Auto-Selection:[/b] Evaluates receiving/yard tracks at destination for length and clearance before dispatch.
[*][b]Realistic Economy & Automation:[/b] Charges distance/tonnage wages, connects air hoses, releases handbrakes, starts engines, and returns 100% control upon arrival.
[/list]

[b][color=#55DD55]2. Autonomous AI Traffic & Signaling[/color][/b]
[list]
[*][b]Realistic Train Operations:[/b] Closed-loop PID throttle/brake regulation, speed profile calculations, Bezier curve evaluation, and powertrain thermal protection.
[*][b]DVSignals Interlocking:[/b] Respects physical German H/V signals, block reservations, player right-of-way, and single-track corridor tokens.
[*][b]Deadlock Immunity:[/b] Passing siding holds, dynamic alternate siding repathing, and safe 5-minute stuck-train despawn safeguards.
[/list]

[size=4][b][color=#FFB833]✦ Requirements & Installation[/color][/b][/size]
[list=1]
[*][b]Derail Valley[/b] (Latest Steam build) + [b]Unity Mod Manager (UMM)[/b] v0.27.0+
[*][b]DVSignals[/b] (Required for block reservations & signal aspects)
[*][b]CommsRadioAPI[/b] (Required for Comms Radio AI Worker mode)
[*][i]Double Track[/i] ([b]Strongly Recommended[/b] to minimize single-track bottlenecks)
[*][b]Persistent Jobs[/b] ([b]Fully Compatible & Supported![/b])
[/list]

[b]Install:[/b] Download [b]AITraffic-v0.2.8.zip[/b] and drop into UMM, or extract into [i]Derail Valley/Mods/[/i].
